      <title>Free Educational Software: working together</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>KDE</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With the emergence of educational Linux distributions, Free Educational Software begins to reach schools. This BoF aims to make all people involved&#xA;in Edutainment (packagers, developers, ...) meet together and present their work in order to start collaborating better.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
